## SQ-EN-25 | 211 IE sawmill recipes written and loaded; log, stripped stage, scales and roots, slabs, button and vertical slab blades; Create saw twisted button and pressure plate; kept over /reload
@group A
@commands boot logs; `/cdevtest bytype immersiveengineering:sawmill max=1000`; `/cdevtest rdetail` on `sawmill/oak_log-oak_planks`, `crimson_stem-crimson_planks`, `ancient_planks-ancient_planks_slab`, `twisted_planks-twisted_button`, `oak_planks-oak_vertical_slab`; `/cdevtest uses architects_palette:twisted_planks`; `/reload`; `bytype` again
@pass KubeJS server log has `[wood] 211 IE sawmill recipes written`, no `[NCH]` error naming `sawmillRaw`; at least 211 `creativeengineering:sawmill/` recipes before and after the reload; the five named ones exist (fields: oak log -> 6 oak planks, bark and sawdust secondaries, stripped oak log stage; crimson stem -> crimson scales and crimson roots; ancient planks -> 2 slabs; twisted planks -> twisted button with the button blade; oak planks -> 2 oak vertical slabs with the vertical slab blade); Create cutting makes the twisted button and pressure plate from twisted planks
@fails NCH `sawmillRaw` (`neoCraftHelper.js`, needs the event with `e.add`); `wood_types.js` species rows (`sawBlades`, `sawCounts`, `sawSecondary`); kubejs-immersive-engineering dropping a raw JSON field (blade, secondaries, stripped); the Create saw rows in the same script
@absent creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_log-oak_planks creativeengineering:sawmill/crimson_stem-crimson_planks creativeengineering:sawmill/ancient_planks-ancient_planks_slab creativeengineering:sawmill/twisted_planks-twisted_button creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_planks-oak_vertical_slab (recipe ids)
kjsexpect \[wood\] 211 IE sawmill recipes written
kjsreject \[NCH\].*sawmillRaw
bootreject \[NCH\].*sawmillRaw
> cdevtest bytype immersiveengineering:sawmill max=1000
count verb=bytype id=creativeengineering:sawmill/ >= 211
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_log-oak_planks
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_log-oak_planks n=1
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:sawmill/crimson_stem-crimson_planks
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:sawmill/crimson_stem-crimson_planks n=1
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:sawmill/ancient_planks-ancient_planks_slab
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:sawmill/ancient_planks-ancient_planks_slab n=1
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:sawmill/twisted_planks-twisted_button
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:sawmill/twisted_planks-twisted_button n=1
> cdevtest rdetail creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_planks-oak_vertical_slab
expect verb=rdetail text=creativeengineering:sawmill/oak_planks-oak_vertical_slab n=1
> cdevtest uses architects_palette:twisted_planks max=200
expect verb=uses id=\S+ .*serializer=create:cutting .*result=architects_palette:twisted_button\*\d+
expect verb=uses id=\S+ .*serializer=create:cutting .*result=architects_palette:twisted_pressure_plate\*\d+
> reload
waitlog (Reloaded|reload) 120
sleep 5
> cdevtest bytype immersiveengineering:sawmill max=1000
waitlog verb=bytype 60
count verb=bytype id=creativeengineering:sawmill/ >= 422
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the rdetail part=fields lines (or a /dumprecipes JSON): oak log result 6 oak planks, secondaries immersive_weathering:oak_bark (stripping) and immersiveengineering:sawdust, stripped minecraft:stripped_oak_log; crimson stem secondaries immersive_weathering:crimson_scales and crimson roots; slab count 2; the button and vertical_slab blades named; if bytype prints result=empty for IE recipes, read the fields

