## CQ-EN-25 | hand: IE Sawmill runs and JEI shows the sawdust secondaries
@group client
@commands creative world: a powered IE Sawmill with a plain sawblade, feed an oak log, a crimson stem, ancient planks; swap to a `button` precision blade and feed twisted planks, a `vertical_slab` blade and oak planks; JEI U on oak planks
@pass oak log -> 6 oak planks + oak bark + sawdust (the stripped stage shows on the belt); crimson stem -> crimson planks + scales + roots; ancient planks -> 2 slabs; twisted button; 2 oak vertical slabs; JEI lists the `creativeengineering:sawmill/` recipes with the sawdust secondary
@fails as SQ-EN-25 (fields lost by kubejs-immersive-engineering); the precision blades come from IE's own items
@draft a powered multiblock and blade swaps: a hand check until a runner writes the steps

## CQ-EN-26 | JEI information pages on the sawblade and the precision sawblade (F2, D5)
@group client
@commands JEI: U (or the info tab) on `immersiveengineering:sawblade`, then on `creativeengineering:precision_sawblade` (any Profile); `grep jei_info logs/kubejs/client.log`
@pass an Information page on each: the sawblade page (logs and wood -> 6 planks with bark and sawdust, planks -> 2 slabs, other shapes need a precision sawblade); the precision page lists the 12 shapes and the Engineer's Workbench recipe; no script error for `engineering/jei_info.js`
@fails the Engineering jar lacks `assets/creativeengineering/kubejs/` (`build.gradle` scriptTrees), or a `requires` header names an absent mod; TODO `engineering/sawmill-and-components #3`
@draft JEI screen by hand
@reviewed 2026-11-22
look both pages present and worded as the pass says
